      "title": "Selected Driver (${driver_acronym}) vs Race Leader - Lap-by-Lap",
      "description": "Lap times of the focus driver (selected via dropdown) overlaid against the lap time of the race leader at that same lap. Highlights traffic, mistakes, undercut/overcut moments, and stint pace deltas.",
